277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (Air campus campaign is an ambitious initiative aimed at raising awareness about air pollution. Air pollution is a pressing global issue with severe consequences for our health and the planet. The people of Dhaka breathe in polluted air for 311 days out of 365 days. But nobody seems to be concerned about it. The IPE Poka-yoke Pioneers team was created out of a deep urge to do something for the people, as nobody specifically ever mentions air pollution, even though it is a pressing issue. This team represents RUET IPE Club and all of its members. All the members of the club are doing all they can for air pollution. The major objectives behind the campaign are:)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 844 0 R
/E (This campaign is dedicated to educating people about the sources of air pollution such as vehicle emissions, industrial processes, household activities, and the harmful effects of pollutants. The vision of the campaign is to create a healthier and cleaner future for all. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
