/E (The Air Campus initiative has effectively leveraged social media platforms like Facebook and Instagram to raise awareness about air pollution through a series of thirteen impactful infographics. These infographics cover a range of topics, providing crucial information and insights to educate the public and inspire action. The post's reach was almost 16k. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
