/E (The Air Campus Campaign has laid a robust foundation for raising awareness about air pollution and advocating for cleaner air. The diverse range of activities and strategic use of digital platforms have effectively engaged a wide audience, fostering a more informed and proactive community. The campaign's success in securing a top 10 position among 256 competitors highlights its potential for driving meaningful change.)
