/P 159 0 R
/E (Moving forward, extending the campaign's duration, securing more resources, and enhancing collaborations could further bolster its impact. The initiative's motto, "Clean Air Starts From Us," encapsulates the core message that individual actions contribute significantly to improving air quality. By continuing to promote this ethos, the Air Campus Campaign can inspire broader societal changes, leading to a healthier and cleaner environment for all.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [6]
>>
