574 0 obj
<<
/Title (The "IPE Poka Yoke Pioneers'' are taking action against air pollution, and Air Campus is a component of that campaign. Recently, the "Let's Breathe Well Clean Air Campaign Design Challenge'' was held by the United Nations Development Programme \(UNDP\). The top 10 teams were chosen from among the over 235 teams that expressed interest in taking part in this campaign from various Bangladeshi universities. The Ruet IPE Club's "IPE Poka Yoke Pioneers" is one of these 10 teams. The primary goals of the Air Campus campaign are community building and raising awareness of the effects of everyday actions on the atmosphere. How they contribute to both environmental and air pollution.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 41 0 R
/Next 1008 0 R
>>
endobj
