1681 0 obj
<<
/Title (vehicles \(EVs\) and their implementation in Rajshahi. She shares her observations on how EVs have contributed to reducing both air and noise pollution in the city. The fourth video addresses the harmful effects of air pollution on health. It includes footage of a student suffering from respiratory issues, illustrating the severe health impacts of polluted air. This video aims to evoke empathy and a sense of urgency among viewers, encouraging them to take action against air pollution. The fifth video features another university student who talks about the significant changes he experienced after moving from Dhaka to Rajshahi. He describes the improved air quality and overall environment in Rajshahi. His testimony serves as a powerful narrative on the benefits of cleaner air. The final video focuses on the major effects of brick kilns on air pollution, presented by a university student. He discusses how brick kilns contribute to significant air quality degradation and their environmental and health impacts. This reel aims to raise awareness about industrial sources of pollution and the need for stricter regulations. All these videos are made to make people more careful about air pollution and to motivate people to make this country a safer place for everyone.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1679 0 R
/Next 1683 0 R
>>
endobj
